{"ticker":"EFX","updated":"2026-10-23T22:54:44Z","profile":{"longName":"Equifax Inc.","shortName":"Equifax, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Consulting Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.equifax.com","fullTimeEmployees":15000,"marketCap":21424545792,"trailingPE":29.508091,"forwardPE":19.048235,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.2500336,"pegRatio":1.56,"targetMeanPrice":198.4,"targetHighPrice":245.0,"targetLowPrice":155.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.096,"earningsGrowth":0.388,"grossMargins":0.55184,"operatingMargins":0.20993,"profitMargins":0.11270001,"totalRevenue":6592099840,"beta":1.341,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":238.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":137.01,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.2},"summary":"Equifax Inc. operates as a data, analytics, and technology company. The company operates through three segments: Workforce Solutions, U.S. Information Solutions (USIS), and International. The Workforce Solutions segment offers services that enables customers to verify income, employment, educational history, criminal justice data, healthcare professional licensure, and sanctions of people in the United States; and employer customers with services that assist them in complying with and automating certain payroll-related and human resource management processes throughout the entire cycle of the employment relationship. The U.S. Information Solutions segment provides consumer and commercial information services, such as credit information and credit scoring, credit modeling and portfolio analytics, locate, fraud detection and prevention, identity verification, and other consulting services; mortgage services; financial marketing services; identity management services; and credit monitoring products. The International segment offers information service products, which include consumer and commercial services comprising credit and financial information, and credit scoring and modeling; and credit and other marketing products and services, as well as information, technology, and services to support debt collections and recovery management. The company also provides information soluti","summary_zh":"Equifax Inc. 是一家數據、分析和技術公司。該公司透過三個部門運作：勞動力解決方案部門、美國資訊解決方案部門 (USIS) 和國際部門。勞動力解決方案部門提供的服務使客戶能夠驗證美國人的收入、就業、教育背景、刑事司法數據、醫療保健專業執照和製裁；為雇主客戶提供服務，幫助他們在整個僱傭關係週期中遵守並自動化某些薪資相關和人力資源管理流程。美國資訊解決方案部門提供消費者和商業資訊服務，例如信用資訊和信用評分、信用建模和投資組合分析、定位、詐欺偵測和預防、身分驗證以及其他諮詢服務；抵押貸款服務；金融行銷服務；身分管理服務；和信用監控產品。國際部門提供資訊服務產品，其中包括消費者和商業服務，包括信用和金融資訊以及信用評分和建模；信貸和其他行銷產品和服務，以及支援債務催收和追收管理的資訊、技術和服務。公司也提供資訊化解決方案","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"諮詢服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":253.33,"h":254.06,"l":250.57,"c":250.76,"v":836500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":250.31,"h":251.86,"l":247.28,"c":247.6,"v":749800},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":246.92,"h":249.32,"l":245.86,"c":245.98,"v":689100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":246.35,"h":246.85,"l":242.97,"c":243.85,"v":735200},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":243.19,"h":246.44,"l":243.19,"c":246.3,"v":694100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":241.73,"h":243.28,"l":233.74,"c":234.03,"v":1558100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":234.4,"h":238.07,"l":234.13,"c":237.49,"v":745600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":239.51,"h":241.32,"l":236.99,"c":240.6,"v":781800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":244.44,"h":254.38,"l":244.44,"c":249.67,"v":1381900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":248.72,"h":253.08,"l":247.07,"c":252.97,"v":902600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":252.83,"h":253.6,"l":248.36,"c":252.01,"v":1080600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":253.3,"h":254.7,"l":244.02,"c":245.55,"v":1031700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":247.31,"h":262.37,"l":247.0,"c":260.23,"v":1153200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":259.36,"h":259.83,"l":255.32,"c":256.25,"v":733400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":258.39,"h":259.83,"l":256.1,"c":256.88,"v":841500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":256.61,"h":261.83,"l":252.87,"c":260.58,"v":1092000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":260.82,"h":271.84,"l":259.55,"c":262.33,"v":1686200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":263.34,"h":266.79,"l":260.15,"c":260.72,"v":1041100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":261.